 black box you just know the director is  going to be around for a while and we  couldn't agree more us  the girl had a second child a boy this  time  they had to cut her open and take him  from her belly  the shadow had to do it all  myself  last up on our list is the horror  mystery thriller us released on march 22  2019 and brought to life by an absolute  dream team of talent jordan peele wrote  and directed lupita nyong'o winston duke  elizabeth moss and tim hydeker star and  jason blum sean mckittrick and ian  cooper produced i mean it's like the  all-star games for cinema neongo plays  adelaide addy wilson mother to zora and  jason and wife to gabriel played by duke  the family decides to go on vacation  returning to the beachfront home that  addie grew up in addy's apprehensive  about the trip due to a traumatic  childhood experience where she wandered  off from her parents and found her way  into a creepy fun house while inside  young addie encountered a perfect  doppelganger of herself within the house  of mirrors and the shocking image has  haunted her ever since now while on  vacation addie can't shake the feeling  that something terrible is going to  happen despite her husband's reassurance  turns out she wasn't just triggered by  her past she had good reason to be  scared because four masked strangers  soon descend upon the house and the  family must fight to survive the  invasion  [Applause]  and here's the kicker each one of the  masked rangers is a perfect doppelganger  of each one of the family members it is  disturbing sometimes funny and always  entertaining in classic jordan peel  fashion us was a commercial triumph  grossing over 255 million dollars  worldwide against a budget of 20 million  dollars it had the second best opening  for a live action original film just  behind 2009's avatar and the best ever  opening for an original horror film that  wasn't based on known property the new  yorker called the film a colossal  achievement the hollywood reporter  called it a fiercely scary movie whose  meaning is up for grabs and rolling  stones described it as spill your soda  scary love that description and there  you have it friends our selections for  the best black horror movies of all time  as always we couldn't mention every film  that fits the bill but don't fret new  episodes of rt essentials are always on  the horizon i'm nas perez and thank you  again for tuning in and remember if you  find yourself in a horror film and  something seems too good to be true  that's because it is  [Music]  [Music]

